+# Route action feedback implementation plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** Use superpowers:executing-plans inline with test-driven-development. User has explicitly authorized this diagnosed repair; do not re-ask approval.
+
+**Goal:** Remove stale historical handles from current action space and prevent re-executing failed actions while preserving truthful on-policy receipts.
+**Architecture:** Opt-in v8, existing passive complete history, current constraints and per-request tools; derive failure memory from original receipts rather than a mutable second archive.
+**Tech Stack:** Python, RDKit, existing HF/vLLM adapters and pytest, pinned shared-storage runtime.
+**Spec:** docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-13-route-action-feedback.md
+
+## Global constraints
+
+All caches/temp/artifacts on Ceph; original corrected History89442; no model/reward/stock/precision change. No output masks or output substitution. Old observation contracts remain replayable. Do not modify unrelated dirty MCTS or unused FP32 diagnostic code.
+
+## Review focus
+
+- Equivalent rejection with different explanation text must reuse execution result.
+- Same action after state change or in a new reaction must remain eligible.
+- Mixed old/new snapshots must recover native local observations exactly.
+- Both HF and vLLM must render actual request tools and retain original token logprobs.
+- Invalid finish cannot terminalize or alter a state; productive finish remains available.
+
+## Task 1: Integrate v8 decision feedback
+
+Files: new src/mechet/route_action_feedback.py and tests/test_route_action_feedback.py; modify route_event_history.py, route_policy_episode.py, route_policy_sampling.py, route_vllm_backend.py.
+
+- [ ] Write failing real-executor tests for unavailable finish, productive finish, source-bond grounding, instruction-insensitive rejection reuse, state/new-reaction reset and snapshot restoration. Add backend-boundary rendering checks.
+- [ ] Run those tests under the shared pinned host runtime and retain RED log.
+- [ ] Implement state-local failure lookup, current constraints, dynamic tools, v8 complete scoped history and restoration. Keep old defaults and unmasked probability collection.
+- [ ] Run new and existing route/history/sampling/backend tests; run project suite once and report unrelated failures by name.
